## Available Options

### Custom Options
| Option | Description | Default | Example |
|--------|-------------|---------|---------|
| `--dry-run` | Preview changes without making updates | `false` | `--dry-run` |
| `--limit` | Maximum records to process | `100` | `--limit=50` |
| `--company-id` | Filter by company ID | `All` | `--company-id=1` |
| `--farm-id` | Filter by farm ID | `All` | `--farm-id=5` |
| `--coop-id` | Filter by coop ID | `All` | `--coop-id=10` |
| `--date` | Use specific date (Y-m-d) | `Current` | `--date=2024-01-15` |
| `--force` | Force update existing numbering | `false` | `--force` |

### Laravel Built-in Options
| Option | Description | Example |
|--------|-------------|---------|
| `--verbose` | Show detailed output | `--verbose` |
| `--quiet` | Suppress all output | `--quiet` |
| `--help` | Show command help | `--help` |
| `--no-interaction` | Non-interactive mode | `--no-interaction` |

## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage
```bash
# Dry run to preview changes
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering --dry-run --verbose

# Fix all missing numbering (default limit: 100)
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering

# Fix with custom limit
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering --limit=500 --verbose
```

### Filtered Usage
```bash
# Fix specific company
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering --company-id=1 --limit=200

# Fix specific farm
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering --farm-id=5 --verbose

# Fix with specific date
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering --date=2024-01-15 --dry-run
```

### Advanced Usage
```bash
# Force update all records
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering --force --limit=50

# Comprehensive fix
php artisan livestock:fix-numbering \
    --company-id=1 \
    --farm-id=5 \
    --limit=200 \
    --date=2024-01-15 \
    --verbose
```

